  "title": "'Product forum' or 'Category' - please unify terminology",
  "content": "<p>If I start a post at the root of the forum tree, there’s no “Product forum” autofilled, and clicking “Create” returns the following red message:</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/1b054d66-1bbc-4d47-92b7-f5d17de12fc1.png\" /></figure><p>which is confusing, as there’s no “category” in the form (that line refers to the “Product forum” line).</p><p>Also, I’d omit the “public” from “Please add at least one public tag”. The public does not need to know that there are other tags than public too.</p><p>JW</p>",
